WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.598 --> 00:00:14.198
Zann thought.

2
00:00:14.218 --> 00:00:17.800
"Maybe I was right, and Mellis is angry that we abandoned her!"

3
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:20.942
But Perda was gesturing for Mellis to come with them.

4
00:00:21.662 --> 00:00:25.784
Without hesitation, Mellis tossed aside her bedding and crawled out of the tent.

5
00:00:26.445 --> 00:00:29.767
The kids all ran for the woods with Zing flying overhead.

6
00:00:30.627 --> 00:00:34.473
Once they were out of sight of the camp, Mellis gestured wildly with her hands.

7
00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:36.454
"Oops," Zann said.

8
00:00:36.474 --> 00:00:38.295
"I forgot she can't speak."

9
00:00:39.115 --> 00:00:40.876
"Hold on," Perda told Mellis.

10
00:00:40.896 --> 00:00:44.217
"I'll see if I can undo the spell Zira put on you.

11
00:00:45.057 --> 00:00:48.999
I've been thinking about it, and I bet it's something called a Muting spell.

12
00:00:49.599 --> 00:00:50.820
I read about it recently.

13
00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:54.521
It was used a lot during the Old Times in Magica."

14
00:00:55.342 --> 00:00:56.302
Zann was impressed.

15
00:00:56.882 --> 00:01:00.224
He hadn't even thought about how they were going to release Mellis from the spell.

16
00:01:01.056 --> 00:01:05.699
He helped Perda create friction, and then she touched Mellis' lips with her finger.

17
00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.862
It took a couple of tries, but finally Mellis let out a gasp.

18
00:01:09.882 --> 00:01:12.324
"Oh, thank you!"

19
00:01:12.824 --> 00:01:14.125
she exclaimed softly.

20
00:01:14.145 --> 00:01:16.446
"But I didn't want you to come back here.

21
00:01:16.466 --> 00:01:19.648
I was hoping you were safe at home in Magica by now!

22
00:01:20.409 --> 00:01:24.071
I tried to help distract Zira and the others by screaming so you could get away."

23
00:01:24.091 --> 00:01:28.834
"So Perda was right, as usual," Zann thought with a smile.

24
00:01:28.854 --> 00:01:30.876
"Thank you," Perda said.

25
00:01:31.372 --> 00:01:32.272
"We did get away.

26
00:01:32.312 --> 00:01:36.273
But while we were in the vortex, we heard something you need to know."

27
00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:43.115
As they walked deeper into the woods, she quickly told Mellis about the oogberry bushes at Zira's house.

28
00:01:44.276 --> 00:01:46.756
"Wow." Mellis looked worried.

29
00:01:46.776 --> 00:01:49.277
"Zira already has too much power.

30
00:01:50.057 --> 00:01:52.878
And my uncle doesn't seem to realize that she's only using him!

31
00:01:53.378 --> 00:01:57.799
He's happy to go along with whatever she suggests, since he loves the attention he gets as the

32
00:01:57.839 --> 00:01:59.460
so-called supreme ruler.

33
00:02:00.076 --> 00:02:04.759
But what will happen once Terrica is fully under her control, and she and Krub don't need him

34
00:02:04.839 --> 00:02:08.641
anymore? I'm afraid for him—and for Terrica."

35
00:02:10.241 --> 00:02:13.603
Zann grabbed Zing to stop him from eating a spiky caterpillar.

36
00:02:13.623 --> 00:02:16.405
"I'm not that worried about Vilkor," he thought.

37
00:02:16.425 --> 00:02:20.507
"He's pretty annoying, and most of the problems are at least partly his fault.

38
00:02:20.947 --> 00:02:24.649
But it would be terrible if Terrica fell under the power of Zira and Krub!"

39
00:02:24.669 --> 00:02:29.732
"We have to do something," he said as he hopped over a fallen tree trunk.

40
00:02:30.528 --> 00:02:31.048
"I know."

41
00:02:32.489 --> 00:02:33.169
Mellis sighed.

42
00:02:33.189 --> 00:02:37.630
"But what can a few kids do against adults who will do anything to gain power?"

43
00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:39.570
Zann grinned.

44
00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:41.071
"You might be surprised.

45
00:02:41.611 --> 00:02:43.672
We told you what happened back in Magica, right?"

46
00:02:44.372 --> 00:02:45.092
Mellis nodded.

47
00:02:45.112 --> 00:02:47.713
"You mean when you guys defeated that guy Morb?

48
00:02:47.733 --> 00:02:49.673
I almost forgot about that."

49
00:02:50.693 --> 00:02:52.074
She smiled back at Zann.

50
00:02:52.094 --> 00:02:54.554
"Maybe there is hope after all!

51
00:02:55.215 --> 00:02:56.775
Especially with you two helping."

52
00:02:56.795 --> 00:02:59.136
"We need a plan," Perda said.

53
00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.240
"Let's—hey, what was that?"

54
00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:03.921
Zann had heard the same sound.

55
00:03:04.521 --> 00:03:08.562
Loud growling and grunting sounds were coming from somewhere in the dark woods.

56
00:03:09.303 --> 00:03:11.223
Mellis' eyes widened with alarm.

57
00:03:11.243 --> 00:03:14.804
"Look!" she whispered, pointing through a break in the trees.

58
00:03:14.824 --> 00:03:16.345
"Rock trompers!"

59
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:18.405
Zann saw them now too.

60
00:03:19.185 --> 00:03:22.726
Several of the huge creatures were chasing after some smaller creatures.

61
00:03:23.286 --> 00:03:25.327
At first he couldn't see what they were.

62
00:03:25.887 --> 00:03:28.488
But when they moved closer, he recognized them.

63
00:03:29.024 --> 00:03:30.505
"Chupos!" he exclaimed.

64
00:03:31.106 --> 00:03:32.607
One of the rock trompers heard him.

65
00:03:33.127 --> 00:03:37.090
It looked at the kids, grunted at the others, and then charged toward them.

66
00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.871
"They see us!"

67
00:03:39.191 --> 00:03:39.852
Mellis cried.

68
00:03:39.872 --> 00:03:42.914
"Run! We have to warn my uncle and the others!"

69
00:03:43.614 --> 00:03:44.955
She ran back toward camp.

70
00:03:44.975 --> 00:03:46.956
"Do a Shield spell!"

71
00:03:47.277 --> 00:03:48.277
Perda called after her.

72
00:03:48.297 --> 00:03:50.579
"Just like we taught you, remember?"

73
00:03:51.239 --> 00:03:56.123
Zann glanced back and saw that the rock trompers and the chupos were both chasing them now.

74
00:03:56.143 --> 00:03:57.844
"Uh-oh," he thought.

75
00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.021
"They're fast!"

76
00:03:59.041 --> 00:04:01.442
"We'd better zap to camp!"

77
00:04:01.842 --> 00:04:03.163
he yelled, grabbing Zing.

78
00:04:03.183 --> 00:04:05.085
"Otherwise we'll never make it.

79
00:04:05.665 --> 00:04:07.806
Zap!" He landed in the clearing.

80
00:04:08.447 --> 00:04:10.828
A split second later, the two girls appeared.

81
00:04:10.848 --> 00:04:12.510
"Join friction!"

82
00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:13.430
Perda cried.

83
00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:15.892
"It's okay—I've got it," Mellis said.

84
00:04:16.472 --> 00:04:20.895
She snapped her fingers, and a glowing purple shield appeared over the entire camp.

85
00:04:21.676 --> 00:04:24.638
Vilkor awakened and sat up, looking dazed.

86
00:04:24.658 --> 00:04:26.719
"What's going on?"

87
00:04:27.239 --> 00:04:27.760
he grumbled.

88
00:04:28.372 --> 00:04:30.674
"I'm trying to sleep!"

89
00:04:30.694 --> 00:04:35.418
"Let's get out of here before he sees us," Zann whispered.

90
00:04:35.859 --> 00:04:36.599
Perda nodded.

91
00:04:36.619 --> 00:04:39.442
"We'll be in touch," she whispered to Mellis.

92
00:04:42.965 --> 00:04:44.786
Then she grabbed Zann and Zing.

93
00:04:44.806 --> 00:04:48.149
"Zap!" They landed in the forest.

94
00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.512
Zann could still hear the rock trompers grunting.

95
00:04:52.012 --> 00:04:53.654
The chupos started howling.

96
00:04:54.054 --> 00:04:58.437
Zann guessed the creatures were frustrated because Mellis' shield had stopped them.

97
00:04:58.937 --> 00:05:00.137
Perda was listening too.

98
00:05:00.157 --> 00:05:02.818
"Let's make our own shield," she said.

99
00:05:02.838 --> 00:05:05.879
"Hold on to Zing for a second so he stays put."

100
00:05:06.959 --> 00:05:08.199
Zann grabbed the dragon.

101
00:05:08.759 --> 00:05:12.200
Perda quickly created a smaller blue bubble over the three of them.

102
00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:13.961
"There," she said.

103
00:05:13.981 --> 00:05:15.761
"Now we can get some sleep.

104
00:05:16.741 --> 00:05:21.243
We'll need to be well rested so we can follow Vilkor wherever he goes tomorrow."

105
00:05:21.983 --> 00:05:28.733
"Right." Zann released Zing and stretched out on the ground, gazing up at the stars that twinkled overhead.

106
00:05:29.393 --> 00:05:32.534
He sneaked a peek at Perda as she settled down beside him.

107
00:05:32.554 --> 00:05:36.095
"The stars look so familiar, don't they?"

108
00:05:36.415 --> 00:05:36.795
she said.

109
00:05:36.815 --> 00:05:40.536
"Looking up, you can almost believe we're back home in Magica."

110
00:05:40.556 --> 00:05:44.437
"Uh-huh." Zann wasn't sure what else to say.

111
00:05:45.197 --> 00:05:49.118
Suddenly he couldn't stop thinking about Darb and Gliss holding hands.

112
00:05:49.138 --> 00:05:52.859
"What if I reached over and held Perda's hand right now?"

113
00:05:53.219 --> 00:05:53.640
he thought.

114
00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:54.940
"What would she think?"

115
00:05:56.352 --> 00:06:01.034
Just then Zing crawled over him and settled down between him and Perda.

116
00:06:01.655 --> 00:06:07.458
Seconds later the little dragon was sound asleep, snoring out smoky breath into Zann's face.

117
00:06:07.478 --> 00:06:10.219
"Good night, Zann," Perda whispered.

118
00:06:10.239 --> 00:06:12.120
"Good night," Zann said.

119
00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:17.823
Then he turned over on his side, away from Zing, and did his best to forget about holding

120
00:06:17.923 --> 00:06:19.183
hands as he fell asleep.
